ite, three hosts. Memory index (`/Users/sto/.claude/projects/-Users-sto-workspace-datomworld/memory/MEMORY.md`) and `collab/1792610000000-orchestrator-handoff-phase8.md` carry the procedures (servers shiva 24c and jupiter 48c, scratch clones `~/ci/datomworld-master`, never test in `~/workspace/datomworld` on the servers, one Dart lane per host, JVM and Dart never share a clone at once, `npm ci` in fresh worktrees, collab never committed, `cp -n` a worktree's collab to main collab before removing it, never touch `datomworld-c4-*`, `datomworld-ad2`, `datomworld-ld1`, never commit to master without green lanes, no Co-Authored-By).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.stack.md:62:> (`yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.md`, forthcoming; landed and renamed\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.stack.md:65:> `collab/1791510000000-architect-semantic-register-vm.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.targets.md:29:> (`yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.md`, forthcoming; landed and renamed\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:5:`collab/1791510000000-architect-semantic-register-vm.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:10:`semantic-register-vm` (this file was\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:11:`yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.md`); the phase-8 cutover (2026-10-15)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:75:> with virtual registers. once we build semantic-register-vm we can\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:76:> delete semantic-vm and rename semantic-register-vm to sematic-vm\")\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:1080:4. **Evaluator.** `yin.vm.semantic-register` beside `yin.vm.semantic`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md:1163:   `yin.vm.semantic-register` to `yin.vm.semantic`, remove the old H/R\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:127:   `yin.vm.semantic-register`, its name until the phase-8 cutover) and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.evaluator.md:1503:> **Evaluator.** `yin.vm.semantic-register` beside `yin.vm.semantic`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:43:> vector (Architect, `colla